      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    weight_x = 0.30\n    weight_y = 0.70\n    std_dev_x = 0.25\n    std_dev_y = 0.10\n    correlation = 0.80\n\n    # Calculate covariance and portfolio standard deviation\n    covariance = correlation * std_dev_x * std_dev_y\n    portfolio_variance = (\n        weight_x**2 * std_dev_x**2\n        + weight_y**2 * std_dev_y**2\n        + 2 * weight_x * weight_y * covariance\n    )\n    portfolio_std_dev_percent = portfolio_variance**0.5 * 100\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(portfolio_std_dev_percent, 2)\n```",
